    "summary": "Use it in your Shooting phase.\n\nPick an **IMPERIAL KNIGHTS** unit of yours not yet picked to shoot in this phase. For the rest of the phase:\n\n- Its models' **[[BLAST]](vsdata:weapon-ability/blast)** weapons may make ranged attacks against enemy units within its **Engagement Range**, provided no other friendly unit is within Engagement Range of the targeted enemy unit.\n- It suffers no **Hit roll** penalty while within Engagement Range of enemy units.\n- Each **[[BLAST]](vsdata:weapon-ability/blast)** attack it makes against a unit within its Engagement Range that rolls an unmodified 1 to hit inflicts 1 **mortal wound** on your unit, after all its attacks are resolved.",
